This licence is intended to apply to users and contributors worldwide.

The permissions granted are worldwide, but they remain subject to mandatory laws applicable in the relevant jurisdiction.

If a provision is held unenforceable in a particular jurisdiction, that provision should be limited only to the extent necessary, and the remaining provisions should continue to apply where legally possible.

